# a bare `jevcode` (a leading flag = chat; TUI-DESIGN-2 §1.1): the session opens in jev-only — the badge in the console's
# top edge, the round-2 placeholder, no wizard (`--mock` needs no key); /exit leaves 0
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect ╭─ (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*jev-only
expect Say hi
expect sess \$
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
